<title>USA: Sallie Mae to buy student loans.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to buy student loans.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Student Loan Marketing Association Wednesday said it has agreed to purchase $915 million of education loans originated by U.S. Bancorp over the next three years.</p>
<p>Sallie Mae said these will include $810 million of loans originated under the Federal Family Education Loan Program (FFLEP), the nation's largest education loan program, and $105 million of loans under Sallie Mae's Signature Education Loan Program, which combines FFELP loans and private, supplemental loans.</p>
</text>
